# Swarm Daemon Stability Patch

The swarm daemon is currently crashing due to a `ReferenceError` and failing to load environment variables gracefully in CI environments.

## Proposed Changes

### [Swarm Core]

#### [MODIFY] [autonomous_trading_controller.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/autonomous_trading_controller.ts)

Export a singleton instance of the controller to match the pattern used by other core modules.

```typescript
export const autonomousTradingController = new AutonomousTradingController();
```

#### [MODIFY] [loop.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/loop.ts)

1.  Make [.env.local](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/.env.local) loading optional and silent when missing.
2.  Import `autonomousTradingController`.
3.  Initialize the controller in the [main](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/loop.ts#205-949) function.

```typescript
import { autonomousTradingController } from './autonomous_trading_controller.js';

// Inside main()
await autonomousTradingController.initialize();
```

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npx tsx swarm/core/loop.ts` (dry run or with mock env).
- Check logs for "Autonomous Trading Controller" status.

### Manual Verification
- Verify that the "Error loading .env.local" is gone or downgraded to a warning.
